00:00:22.488 --> 00:00:24.224
Hey, everybody.

00:00:24.224 --> 00:00:26.292
These are two of our writers,
Amber and Jenny.

00:00:26.292 --> 00:00:28.194
-I'm Black.
-And I'm gay.

00:00:28.194 --> 00:00:30.029
-And we're both women.
-And I'm not,

00:00:30.029 --> 00:00:31.964
so I'll read the set-ups
for these jokes,

00:00:31.964 --> 00:00:33.800
and Amber and Jenny
will read the punch lines.

00:00:33.800 --> 00:00:35.101
Here we go.

00:00:35.101 --> 00:00:36.535
According to "Men's Journal,"

00:00:36.535 --> 00:00:39.539
the best dating app
for gay men is eHarmony.

00:00:39.539 --> 00:00:43.776
-While the best for lesbians
is TaskRabbit.

00:00:43.776 --> 00:00:45.378
-The city of Birmingham,
Alabama,

00:00:45.378 --> 00:00:48.181
