recently in white neighborhoods.

00:00:48.181 --> 00:00:49.548
-White neighborhoods --

00:00:49.548 --> 00:00:51.417
or as they're more
commonly known,

00:00:51.417 --> 00:00:53.386
former Black neighborhoods.

00:00:53.386 --> 00:00:56.656
-A new viral TikTok trend
features users

00:00:56.656 --> 00:01:00.026
