00:01:04.630 --> 00:01:06.766
-Is that really
where you keep your keys?

00:01:06.766 --> 00:01:09.536
-Yes, and then I hang this from
the belt loop of my pants.

00:01:09.536 --> 00:01:11.504
-And what if
you're wearing a skirt?

00:01:11.504 --> 00:01:14.140
[ Laughter ]

00:01:14.140 --> 00:01:16.876
Can you imagine?
What would that even look like?

00:01:16.876 --> 00:01:19.312
-I don't know. Good one, bud.
-[ Sighs ]

00:01:19.312 --> 00:01:21.080
Serena Williams
